    {"name": "Novice"},
    {"name": "Apprentice", "again": "\"Again? Good -- I learn as much from these as you do. Come back whenever you like.\"", "rematch": {"airrune": 20, "mindrune": 20, "waterrune": 10, "earthrune": 10}, "beaten": "\"Ow. All right -- that was a proper spell, not a lucky spark. Your training's paying off. Keep at your runes; Selene upstairs won't go easy on you.\"", "needs": {"magic": 10, "runecrafting": 5}, "duel": "apprenticemage", "coins": 300},
    {"name": "Adept", "again": "\"I'll keep a duelling circle chalked for you. Any time you want the practice.\"", "rematch": {"firerune": 15, "chaosrune": 10}, "beaten": "\"You held your focus when I pressed you. Most apprentices let go. Your training is paying off -- the Magus will want to see it for himself.\"", "needs": {"magic": 20, "runecrafting": 15, "enchanting": 10}, "duel": "adeptmage", "coins": 800},
    {"name": "Mage", "again": "\"A rematch keeps us both sharp. My door's open -- bring runes.\"", "rematch": {"naturerune": 8, "cosmicrune": 8}, "beaten": "\"Hm. Thirty years I've taught in this tower, and not many have put me on the floor. Wear the robes of a Mage, then. Nyx is on the next floor. She won't be impressed -- so make her be.\"", "needs": {"magic": 30, "runecrafting": 25, "enchanting": 20}, "duel": "magusmage", "coins": 2000},
    {"name": "Sorcerer", "again": "\"I'd like to try that again. And again. Come back and duel me whenever you're passing.\"", "rematch": {"astralrune": 6, "lawrune": 6}, "beaten": "\"...Well. I'd forgotten what losing feels like. You're a Sorcerer now, and only Vale stands above you. He's been watching you climb. He'll be waiting.\"", "needs": {"magic": 40, "runecrafting": 35, "enchanting": 30}, "duel": "sorceressmage", "coins": 4000},
    {"name": "Archmage", "again": "\"Even an Archmage needs a sparring partner. Climb the stairs whenever you like.\"", "rematch": {"deathrune": 6, "astralrune": 4}, "beaten": "\"So. The top of the tower, and nothing left here to teach you.\" He sits down slowly. \"Nothing in the tower, anyway.\"", "needs": {"magic": 50, "runecrafting": 44, "enchanting": 40}, "duel": "archmagemage", "coins": 8000}
